meta {
  name: ArchiveController
  seq: 10
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
    GET  /archive/books    admin only
    GET  /archive/copies   admin only

  Logically deleted books, and copies deleted on their own, most recently deleted first.
  The journal behind them names borrowers, hence admin only: a librarian or a student
  gets 403. The timeline of any one of them is `getBookHistory` / `getCopyHistory`.
}
